chore(catalog): re-pin meshy to c16e967d (meshy-mcp-server 0.6.5)

Picks up hermes-official-plugins#148: the Meshy plugin now pins
@meshy-ai/meshy-mcp-server 0.6.5, whose User-Agent names the MCP host
from the handshake clientInfo ("meshy-mcp-server/0.6.5 (hermes-agent/<v>)"),
